{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 53, :comments ["<b>To these the land shall be divided.</b> And not to those under twenty — even though they were included in the count of twenty before the division of the land; for seven years they conquered and seven years they divided, and none took a portion in the land except those six hundred and one thousand, and if one of them had six sons they took only their father's portion alone (Bava Batra 117)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:53.037855296Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}